---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Carousel } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="Carousel">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>Carousel</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      One slide in view, the rest a gesture away. Arrows, dots, and keyboard
      come standard; autoplay stays off unless you ask.
    </p>

    <h2>Example</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <Carousel label="Feature tour">
        <div style="padding: var(--ink-space-5); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink-accent) 12%, var(--ink-surface));"><strong>Slide 1.</strong> Meet the library.</div>
        <div style="padding: var(--ink-space-5); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink-info) 12%, var(--ink-surface));"><strong>Slide 2.</strong> Tokens everywhere.</div>
        <div style="padding: var(--ink-space-5); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink-success) 12%, var(--ink-surface));"><strong>Slide 3.</strong> Ship it.</div>
      </Carousel>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Carousel label="Feature tour"&gt;
  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slide 1.&lt;/strong&gt; Meet the library.&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slide 2.&lt;/strong&gt; Tokens everywhere.&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slide 3.&lt;/strong&gt; Ship it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/Carousel&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Autoplay</h2>
    <p>Pass <code>autoplay</code> with an optional <code>interval</code> (ms). It pauses on hover, focus, and reduced motion.</p>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>label</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>Carousel</code></td><td>Region name.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>autoplay</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Advance automatically.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>interval</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>5000</code></td><td>Autoplay delay ms.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li>Slides announce "N of M"; dots are labeled buttons with current state.</li>
      <li>Arrow keys work when focus is inside; autoplay never runs under reduced motion.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
